  "description": "Ji-Woo, a quiet college student, had been idolizing Da-Jung, a popular junior on campus. Da-Jung had also been developing feelings for Ji-Woo, a top student in his department, since their freshman year... Si-Won, who was watching from the side, simply couldn't stand this whole situation. Then one day, after a terribly difficult day, Si-Won reached out to Ji-Woo with a fatally tempting touch that was hard to resist...\n\n *\"Your lips are so sexy.\"\n\n\"What time do you finish?\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Bomtoon and Lezhin's Dulbodaneun Sen Danpyeonseon (둘보다는 셋 단편선) Collection.*",
